text CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_EeveeCanEvolveIntroThreeMons {
    "EEVEE can evolve into one of three\n"
    "kinds of POKéMON.$"
}

text CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_LegendaryBirdEmail {
    "There's an e-mail message.\p"
    "… … …\p"
    "There are three legendary bird\n"
    "POKéMON.\p"
    "They are ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS, and\n"
    "MOLTRES.\p"
    "Their whereabouts are unknown.\p"
    "We plan to explore the cavern\n"
    "close to CERULEAN.\p"
    "From: POKéMON RESEARCH TEAM…$"
}

text CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_AnAmberPipe {
    "An amber pipe!$"
}
